      ],
      "sha256": "d3458bab206b3101c2f007f75306d34de90ea06e56213a6fa9245535ce879c86",
      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 6. Sixteen participants compare Baseline and SPARK. Each following pair gives mean and standard deviation for Baseline, then SPARK: comprehensive progress monitoring, 2.19 (1.28) and 4.63 (0.62); detailed trajectory insights, 2.63 (1.15) and 4.63 (0.62); identifying students falling behind, 2.81 (1.42) and 4.88 (0.34); identifying student challenges, 2.06 (1.06) and 4.13 (1.09); assessing element functionality, 1.69 (0.79) and 4.44 (0.96); inspecting element behavior variations, 1.69 (1.01) and 4.69 (0.48). Quiz correct answers out of five: 2.50 (0.97) and 4.69 (0.70). Unsure answers out of five: 2.56 (1.46) and 0.31 (0.79). The first six rows include stacked response distributions; the last two include boxplots. The source legend labels its darkest category “Not Used”, although those bars coincide with high mean ratings."
    },
    {
